-- =====================================================================================
-- DEMO CATALOG  (33 sample sarees; NOT for production)
-- =====================================================================================
-- The sample products the storefront showed while it ran on mock data, with placeholder images and
-- invented prices. Each variant's stock is real pieces: this file inserts rows into pos.products (the shop's
-- inventory, SKUs prefixed DEMO-) and links them to the variants. Apply it only to a development or staging
-- database. Remove it again with:
--   DELETE FROM pos.products WHERE sku LIKE 'DEMO-%';  -- cascades to the stock links
--   DELETE FROM store.products WHERE slug IN (SELECT slug FROM store.products WHERE description LIKE 'A % saree from the %');
-- Needs 91_seed_storefront_content.sql first (it creates the collections). Safe to re-run.

